[2026-06-11T10:09:00.017Z] [STDOUT] Fixes #54

## Summary
- Adds a `LinkStore` storage trait plus `EngineLinkStore`/`EngineNetwork` implementations so reads use `&self`, writes use `&mut self`, and read-only access mode rejects mutations at the storage boundary.
- Adds the optional `doublets` feature with `DoubletsLinkStore`, backed by file-mapped `doublets-rs` 0.4 records, preserving link ids, metadata, spans, flags, term registrations, and LiNo equivalence.
- Documents the in-memory default store, native doublets backend, `doublets-web` exchange target, and adds a minor changelog fragment.

## Reproduction and Verification
- `tests/unit/storage.rs` covers in-memory CRUD/search and read-only write rejection.
- `tests/unit/doublets_storage.rs` covers language fixture round trips through file-mapped doublets storage, LiNo text to binary equivalence, CRUD/search, and read-only behavior.

## Local Checks
- `cargo fmt --check`
- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`
- `cargo test --all-features`
- `rust-script scripts/check-no-src-tests.rs`
- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs`
- `rust-script scripts/check-crate-size.rs`
